agm-0980: AGM H6 backlight. SweetFramebuffer drives PWM channel 2 of the sprd
PWM block (0x643f0000, the stock DT's sprd_backlight, 25 kHz) where topaz sends DSI DCS
commands: display off sets the duty to 0, display on and IOMFBBrightnessLevel (CoreBrightness,
nits) set it from the DBV (0..0x7ff) scaled to u-boot's period; the AppleARMBacklight service
(backlight-control) only with sweetbl=1: CoreBrightness then takes backboardd's main thread. agm_bl=0: left alone.

